    "Which chains appear on the app's 'Near me' map, and how to find their stores in OpenStreetMap.",
    "Each brand lists the app deal IDs (AFP-xxxx) it belongs to. The app only shows a store if that deal is still in its live deal list.",
    "match: either a Wikidata ID (OSM tag brand:wikidata, the most reliable) or an exact brand/name.",
    "Only add chains whose military discount is used IN THE STORE at most locations. Leave out car dealers, hotels, rental cars, phone plans, and deals that are 'select locations only' or not running.",
    "participating: true = the business says not every location takes part; the app says so on the map.",
    "requireTag: only keep places with this tag (e.g. Take 5 oil change shops, not Take 5 car washes).",
    "excludeName: skip places whose name matches this pattern (case-insensitive)."
  ],
